":{\"title\":\"Trusted by 400,000+ users worldwide!\",\"reviewList\":{\"alexander\":{\"initials\":\"AC\",\"review\":\"With PdfHouse I merged two reports into one file. This helped me submit my work in a clean format. The merge pdf feature was easy to use. I just uploaded the files arranged the order and clicked one button. The file came out perfect. I liked how easy it is for office work.\",\"name\":\"Alexander C.\"},\"laurent\":{\"initials\":\"LD\",\"review\":\"Outstanding online pdf conversion experience with PDF House. Converted images to PDF format in seconds. The quality remained crystal clear. This online pdf service exceeds all my expectations completely.\",\"name\":\"Laurent D.\"},\"emma\":{\"initials\":\"EC\",\"review\":\"I needed to convert PDF to Word for a report. PDF House made it super easy. Now I use it all the time.\",\"name\":\"Emma C.\"},\"steve\":{\"initials\":\"ST\",\"review\":\"Quick, knowledgeable and helpful - easy to deal with.\",\"name\":\"Steve T.\"},\"oscar\":{\"initials\":\"OF\",\"review\":\"I tried pdf conversion without using any software. The online tool was very easy and fast. It helped me edit pdfs and merge pdf with no issues.\",\"name\":\"Oscar F.\"},\"nina\":{\"initials\":\"NS\",\"review\":\"Editing PDFs is super easy here. I use PDF House to crop pdf files when I want only a part of the page. It is simple and works very quickly.\",\"name\":\"Nina S.\"},\"amanda\":{\"initials\":\"AB\",\"review\":\"Very responsive agent and very helpful and concise.\",\"name\":\"Amanda B.\"},\"louise\":{\"initials\":\"LH\",\"review\":\"I needed to edit pdfs for my project and PdfHouse helped a lot. The merge pdf feature was easy to use. I also signed documents online and filled pdf forms fast. Online pdf conversion worked without problems. I will continue using this online pdf service for my assignments.\",\"name\":\"Louise H.\"}}},\"faqSection\":{\"title\":\"Frequently asked questions\",\"questionList\":{\"whoWeAre\":{\"title\":\"What exactly is {brandName}?\",\"text\":\"{brandName} is an online platform that enables users to work with PDF files by editing, converting, splitting, compressing, merging, and more. We also support a wide array of formats, allowing conversions both to and from PDF. These include popular options like Word, Excel, JPG, and PNG, as well as legacy formats such as DjVu and specialized formats like DWG. We continuously broaden our range of tools and refine existing features to meet user needs, taking their feedback into account.\"},\"osAvailability\":{\"title\":\"Which platforms can I use {brandName} on?\",\"text\":\"{brandName} is a web-based application accessible through any browser on any device with an internet connection. Unlike installed software, online applications are compatible with a variety of operating systems. You can manage and modify PDF files using {brandName} on macOS, Windows, Linux, iOS, or Android, as long as you remain connected to the internet.\"},\"features\":{\"title\":\"What features does {brandName} offer?\",\"text\":\"{brandName} offers core features, including merging, splitting, compressing, converting between formats (e.g., PDF to Word/Excel and vice versa), editing text and images, and adding e-signatures.\"},\"supportedFormats\":{\"title\":\"Which file formats are compatible with {brandName}?\",\"text\":\"To date, our online to PDF converter supports the following formats: Word, JPG, PNG, Excel, EPUB, DOC, DOCX, HTML, TXT, PPTX, MOBI, SVG, CSV, AZW3, PPT, etc. However, we're always expanding our list of available file extensions to make PDF management more convenient for our users. Therefore, if you want to request a specific format, feel free to share your proposal with our support team\"},\"supportContact\":{\"title\":\"How should I proceed if I run into problems or technical errors while using {brandName}?\",\"text\":\"Should you encounter any difficulties using our PDF tool, please be advised that our customer support team is available 24/7 via online chat. You can always reach us through live chat for immediate assistance. Alternatively, you may also contact us via any of these channels: E-mail: \u003csupportEmailLink\u003e\u003c/supportEmailLink\u003e Phone: \u003csupportPhoneLink\u003e\u003c/supportPhoneLink\u003e We provide human customer support 24/7, even on holidays and weekends, which sets us apart from companies that rely solely on chatbots. Our experienced consultants are always available to guide you through any problem.\"}}},\"tools\":{\"title\":\"One platform, 50+ online PDF tools\",\"description\":\"Get all the essential PDF House tools to edit, sign, and manage your PDFs — no downloads needed.\",\"showLess\":\"Show less\",\"showMore\":\"Show more\",\"createTemplate\":{\"title\":\"Create template\",\"description\":\"Transform PDFs into customizable templates and fillable forms.\"},\"editPdf\":{\"title\":\"Edit PDF online\",\"description\":\"Upload your document to start editing, signing, merging, or converting — all in one place, all online.\"},\"splitPdf\":{\"title\":\"Split PDF\",\"description\":\"Extract separate pages or divide your PDF file into multiple ones.\"},\"mergePdf\":{\"title\":\"Merge PDF files into one\",\"description\":\"Create a single PDF from multiple documents.\"},\"compressPdf\":{\"title\":\"Compress PDF while maintaining layout\",\"description\":\"Smaller PDFs, same great quality — shrink file size easily.\"},\"signPdf\":{\"title\":\"Sign PDFs in seconds\",\"description\":\"Easily add your digital signature to any PDF document.\"},\"rotatePdf\":{\"title\":\"Rotate upside-down PDFs\",\"description\":\"No need to twist your screen — fix flipped pages in a click.\"},\"addWatermarks\":{\"title\":\"Add watermarks\",\"description\":\"Stamp it — add logos or custom text watermarks to protect your files.\"}},\"security\":{\"title\":\"Your security is our #1 priority\",\"description\":\"{brandName} adheres to top industry standards and regulations, guaranteeing safety of your files and data.\"},\"relatedFormsSection\":{\"title\":\"Pick a form and fill it out — 300+ templates\",\"subtitle\":\"Save time with custom forms for taxes, contracts, agreements, and more — ready to fill and send.\",\"buttonText\":\"View all forms\",\"form\":\"Form\",\"statement\":\"Statement\",\"viewButton\":\"View form\"},\"about\":{\"title\":\"About {brandName} editor \u0026 converter\",\"description\":\"We created {brandName} in 2011 to simplify everyday tasks like editing, converting, signing, or securing PDFs. Today, it’s an all-in-one online PDF editor and converter relied on by thousands of people worldwide. {brandName} is private, efficient, and works right in your web browser.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003eBuilt for everyday needs, it’s widely used for editing and converting documents, filling out forms, and fixing grammar and spelling mistakes. \",\"convertTo\":\"\u003ch3\u003eConvert to and from PDF: online, fast, secure\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eNeed to convert a Word file to PDF, or a PDF back to Excel or PowerPoint? {brandName} handles it all. Our platform supports a wide range of file formats and performs conversions in seconds while keeping your data protected.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"edit\":{\"content\":\"\u003ch3\u003eEdit your documents with 50+ online PDF tools\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e{brandName} offers a set of powerful tools to help you get the job done, whether it’s a quick edit or a full transformation. You can:\u003c/p\u003e\",\"steps\":{\"edit\":\"Edit text directly in PDFs\",\"highlight\":\"Highlight or underline important information\",\"rearrange\":\"Rearrange or delete pages\",\"merge\":\"Merge multiple PDFs into one\",\"compress\":\"Compress files for faster sharing\",\"split\":\"Split large documents into smaller ones\",\"watermark\":\"Add watermarks, annotations, and e-signatures\",\"redact\":\"Redact sensitive information\",\"secure\":\"Secure documents with passwords or encryption\"}},\"howToUse\":\"\u003ch3\u003eHow to use {brandName}\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eUsing {brandName} is simple. It works entirely in your browser, so there's no software to install or learn. Just follow these steps:\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e1. Upload one or more files from your device.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e2. Edit, convert, merge, split, or compress the files.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e3. Sign, watermark, redact, or password-protect your PDF, if needed.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e4. Save changes and download your document.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\"}}},\"landingPageShared\":{\"heroSection\":{\"uploadField\":{\"addFile\":\"Add file\",\"mergeFiles\":\"Merge files\",\"mergePDF\":\"Merge PDF\",\"convertPDF\":\"Convert to PDF\",\"errors\":{\"title\":\"Error message\",\"sizeExceeded\":\"The file size must not exceed {max} MB\",\"wrongFormatBriefly\":\"The file type is not valid\",\"wrongFormatFully\":\"The file type is not valid. Allowed file types: {fileTypes}\",\"failedToMerge\":\"Failed to merge files\",\"failedToConvertFiles\":\"Failed to convert some files\",\"failedToCompressFile\":\"Failed to compress file\",\"failedToConvertFileToPDF\":\"Failed to convert file to PDF\",\"failedToExtractImages\":\"Failed to extract images\",\"failedToProcessFileForOCR\":\"Failed to process file. The file may be corrupted or in an unsupported format.\",\"noImagesFoundTitle\":\"No images found in this PDF\",\"noImagesFound\":\"Make sure your PDF has images and try again.\",\"somethingWentWrong\":\"Something went wrong. Try again\",\"cantCompressProtectedFile\":\"Can't compress protected file\",\"cantExtractImagesFromProtectedFile\":\"Can't extract images from protected file\",\"onlyPDFCanBeMerged\":\"Only PDF files can be merged\",\"unknown\":\"File validation failed for an unknown reason\"},\"conversionInProgress\":{\"title\":\"Converting your document...\",\"caption\":\"Please wait while we convert your file for you\",\"description\":\"Converting\",\"done\":\"Converted\"},\"pdfToWordConversionInProgress\":{\"title\":\"Uploading your PDF...\",\"caption\":\"Please wait a moment.\",\"description\":\"Processing\",\"done\":\"Uploaded\"},\"compressingInProgress\":{\"title\":\"Compressing your document...\",\"titleImage\":\"Compressing your Image...\",\"caption\":\"Please wait a moment\",\"description\":\"Processing\",\"done\":\"Compressed\"},\"ocrInProgress\":{\"title\":\"Performing OCR...\",\"caption\":\"Please wait a moment\",\"description\":\"Processing\",\"done\":\"Applied\"},\"deleteImagesInProgress\":{\"title\":\"Analyzing your document…\",\"caption\":\"Please wait a moment\",\"description\":\"Processing\",\"done\":\"Analyzed\"},\"readyToRemoveImages\":{\"title\":\"Ready to remove images\",\"description\":\"We found images in your PDF. Do you want to remove them from the document?\",\"cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"remove\":\"Remove\"},\"cloudIntegration\":{\"title\":\"Feature not available yet\",\"description\":\"We're currently working on cloud integration. Please upload a file from your device instead.\",\"toastButtonText\":\"Upload\",\"buttonText\":\"Upload your file\",\"options\":{\"fromDevice\":\"From your device\",\"fromDropbox\":\"From Dropbox\",\"fromGoogleDrive\":\"From Google Drive\",\"fromOneDrive\":\"From OneDrive\"}},\"extractingInProgress\":{\"title\":\"Extracting images...\",\"caption\":\"Please wait a moment\",\"description\":\"Processing\",\"done\":\"Extracted\"},\"flatteningInProgress\":{\"title\":\"Flattening your PDF...\",\"caption\":\"Please wait a moment.\",\"description\":\"Processing\",\"done\":\"Flattened\"},\"disclaimers\":{\"minFilesRequired\":\"Please upload at least two PDF files to merge.\",\"maxFilesExceeded\":\"You exceeded your limit of {maxFilesCount} files\"}}},\"toolsSection\":{\"title\":\"One platform for all your PDF tools\",\"convertFromPDFTitle\":\"Convert from PDF\",\"convertToPDFTitle\":\"Convert to PDF\",\"editPDFTitle\":\"Edit\u0026Sign\",\"toolList\":{\"PDFToWord\":\"PDF to Word\",\"WordToPDF\":\"Word to PDF\",\"PDFToExcel\":\"PDF to Excel\",\"ExcelToPDF\":\"Excel to PDF\",\"PDFToPPT\":\"PDF to PPT\",\"PPToPDF\":\"PPT to PDF\",\"PDFToJPG\":\"PDF to JPG\",\"JPGToPDF\":\"JPG to PDF\",\"createTemplate\":\"Create template\",\"splitPDF\":\"Split PDF\",\"mergePDF\":\"Merge PDF\",\"compressPDF\":\"Compress PDF\",\"editPDF\":\"Edit PDF\",\"watermarkPDF\":\"Add watermark\",\"rotatePDF\":\"Rotate PDF\",\"signPDF\":\"Sign PDF\"}},\"howItWorksSection\":{\"title\":\"Edit your PDF file online in 3 steps\",\"stepList\":{\"upload\":\"Upload the PDF file you want to modify.\",\"edit\":\"Use editing tools to add text, images, and more.\",\"download\":\"Review your changes and download the updated document.\"}},\"reviewsSection\":{\"title\":\"What our users are saying\",\"reviewList\":{\"alexander\":{\"initials\":\"AC\",\"review\":\"With PdfHouse I merged two reports into one file. This helped me submit my work in a clean format. The merge pdf feature was easy to use. I just uploaded the files arranged the order and clicked one button. The file came out perfect. I liked how easy it is for office work.\",\"name\":\"Alexander C.\"},\"laurent\":{\"initials\":\"LD\",\"review\":\"Outstanding online pdf conversion experience with PDF House. Converted images to PDF format in seconds. The quality remained crystal clear. This online pdf service exceeds all my expectations completely.\",\"name\":\"Laurent D.\"},\"emma\":{\"initials\":\"EC\",\"review\":\"I needed to convert PDF to Word for a report. PDF House made it super easy. Now I use it all the time.\",\"name\":\"Emma C.\"},\"steve\":{\"initials\":\"ST\",\"review\":\"Quick, knowledgeable and helpful - easy to deal with.\",\"name\":\"Steve T.\"},\"oscar\":{\"initials\":\"OF\",\"review\":\"I tried pdf conversion without using any software. The online tool was very easy and fast. It helped me edit pdfs and merge pdf with no issues.\",\"name\":\"Oscar F.\"},\"nina\":{\"initials\":\"NS\",\"review\":\"Editing PDFs is super easy here. I use PDF House to crop pdf files when I want only a part of the page. It is simple and works very quickly.\",\"name\":\"Nina S.\"},\"amanda\":{\"initials\":\"AB\",\"review\":\"Very responsive agent and very helpful and concise.\",\"name\":\"Amanda B.\"},\"louise\":{\"initials\":\"LH\",\"review\":\"I needed to edit pdfs for my project and PdfHouse helped a lot. The merge pdf feature was easy to use. I also signed documents online and filled pdf forms fast. Online pdf conversion worked without problems. I will continue using this online pdf service for my assignments.\",\"name\":\"Louise H.\"}}},\"faqSection\":{\"title\":\"Frequently asked questions\",\"questionList\":{\"whoWeAre\":{\"title\":\"What exactly is {brandName}?\",\"text\":\"{brandName} is an online platform that enables users to work with PDF files by editing, converting, splitting, compressing, merging, and more. We also support a wide array of formats, allowing conversions both to and from PDF. These include popular options like Word, Excel, JPG, and PNG, as well as legacy formats such as DjVu and specialized formats like DWG. We continuously broaden our range of tools and refine existing features to meet user needs, taking their feedback into account.\"},\"osAvailability\":{\"title\":\"Which platforms can I use {brandName} on?\",\"text\":\"{brandName} is a web-based application accessible through any browser on any device with an internet connection. Unlike installed software, online applications are compatible with a variety of operating systems. You can manage and modify PDF files using {brandName} on macOS, Windows, Linux, iOS, or Android, as long as you remain connected to the internet.\"},\"features\":{\"title\":\"What features does {brandName} offer?\",\"text\":\"{brandName} offers core features, including merging, splitting, compressing, converting between formats (e.g., PDF to Word/Excel and vice versa), editing text and images, and adding e-signatures.\"},\"supportedFormats\":{\"title\":\"Which file formats are compatible with {brandName}?\",\"text\":\"To date, our online to PDF converter supports the following formats: Word, JPG, PNG, Excel, EPUB, DOC, DOCX, HTML, TXT, PPTX, MOBI, SVG, CSV, AZW3, PPT, etc. However, we're always expanding our list of available file extensions to make PDF management more convenient for our users. Therefore, if you want to request a specific format, feel free to share your proposal with our support team\"},\"supportContact\":{\"title\":\"How should I proceed if I run into problems or technical errors while using {brandName}?\",\"text\":\"Should you encounter any difficulties using our PDF tool, please be advised that our customer support team is available 24/7 via online chat. You can always reach us through live chat for immediate assistance. Alternatively, you may also contact us via any of these channels: E-mail: support@pdfhouse.com Phone: +1 (833) 470-2108 We provide human customer support 24/7, even on holidays and weekends, which sets us apart from companies that rely solely on chatbots. Our experienced consultants are always available to guide you through any problem.\"}}},\"conversionDialog\":{\"title\":\"Processing document\",\"caption\":\"Please wait while our engine does the work for you\",\"progress\":\"{percentages}%\"},\"conversionInProgressDialog\":{\"title\":\"Conversion in progress...\",\"stepList\":{\"downloading\":\"Downloading\",\"converting\":\"Converting the document\",\"securing\":\"Securing the document\"}},\"whyChooseUsSection\":{\"title\":\"Why choose {brandName}?\",\"description\":\"From quick fixes to share-ready documents, get everything done in one place.\",\"buttonText\":\"Upload your file\",\"benefitList\":{\"oneCompleteWorkspace\":{\"title\":\"One complete workspace\",\"description\":\"Edit, convert, compress, merge, split, and sign PDFs without switching tabs.\"},\"accuracyYouCanTrust\":{\"title\":\"Accuracy you can trust\",\"description\":\"Get pixel-perfect, editable files in seconds, even from scanned documents.\"},\"builtInSecurity\":{\"title\":\"Built-in security\",\"description\":\"Access files securely right in your browser, protected by automatic encryption.\"}}}},\"conversionLandingPage\":{\"metaData\":{\"title\":\"Convert {sourceFormat} to {targetFormat} - Made Simple With {brandName}\",\"description\":\"Convert {sourceFormat} to {targetFormat}: Simply click on \\\"Upload {sourceFormat} To Convert\\\" or drop your file in \\\"Drop {sourceFormat} Files Here\\\". Make any edits your document may need.\"},\"content\":{\"landingSpecificTitles\":{\"pdf-to-picture\":\"Convert PDF to Picture\",\"pdf-to-image\":\"Convert PDF to Image\",\"pdf-to-pages\":\"Convert PDF to Pages\",\"pdf-to-excel\":\"Convert PDF to Excel\",\"pdf-to-word\":\"Convert PDF to Word\",\"excel-to-pdf\":\"Convert Excel to PDF\",\"word-to-pdf\":\"Convert Word to PDF\",\"power-point-to-pdf\":\"Convert PowerPoint to PDF\",\"picture-to-pdf\":\"Convert Picture to PDF\",\"pages-to-pdf\":\"Convert Pages to PDF\",\"image-to-pdf\":\"Convert Image to PDF\",\"image-to-excel\":\"Convert Image to Excel\",\"image-to-word\":\"Convert Image to Word\",\"pdf-to-power-point\":\"Convert PDF to Power Point\"},\"heroSection\":{\"title\":\"Convert {sourceFormat} to {targetFormat}\",\"caption\":\"Quickly and easily convert files to any format.\",\"uploadField\":{\"caption\":\"or drop your file here\",\"buttonText\":\"Upload your file\",\"hint\":\"Size up to {size} MB\",\"multipleHint\":\"You can upload up to {fileAmount} images, each file size to {size} MB.\"}},\"howItWorksSection\":{\"title\":\"Convert your file in 3 simple steps\",\"stepList\":{\"first\":\"Upload your file.\",\"second\":\"Enter your email or sign in.\",\"third\":\"Download your converted file instantly.\"}},\"getStartedSection\":{\"title\":\"Convert Your Files in Seconds\",\"caption\":\"Upload your file and convert it to the format you need — quickly and effortlessly.\",\"action\":\"Upload your file\"}}},\"myDocumentsPage\":{\"metaData\":{\"title\":\"My docs\"},\"content\":{\"getFeedbackDialog\":{\"title\":\"How’s your experience with {brandName}?\",\"caption\":\"Your rating helps us improve the tools you use.\",\"whatToDoBetter\":\"What can we do better?\",\"tellUsMore\":\"Please tell us more:\",\"typeTextHere\":\"Type your text here\",\"sendFeedback\":\"Send feedback\",\"reviewOnTrustpilot\":\"Leave a quick review on Trustpilot to help us get better\",\"trustpilotLinkWidget\":\"Review us on \u003ctrustpilotLogo\u003e\u003c/trustpilotLogo\u003e\"},\"feedbackSuccessDialog\":{\"title\":\"Your feedback has been sent successfully!\",\"caption\":\"We appreciate your input in helping us improve our service!\"},\"documentDeletionDialog\":{\"title\":\"Are you sure you want to delete \\\"{documentName}\\\"?\",\"cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"delete\":\"Delete\"}}},\"paymentPage\":{\"metaData\":{\"title\":\"Payment\"},\"content\":{\"youReOnTheLastStep\":\"Final step to get your document\",\"paymentForm\":{\"payAndDownloadDocument\":\"Pay and download document\",\"totalDueToday\":\"Total due today:\",\"expressCheckout\":\"Express checkout\",\"payWithCard\":\"Pay with card\",\"secureEncryptedPayment\":\"This is a secure 128-bit encrypted payment\",\"complianceWarning\":\"You must check the box below\",\"agreementDisclaimer\":\"By checking this box, you agree to the \u003ctermsLink\u003eTerms of Use \u0026 Service\u003c/termsLink\u003e, \u003cprivacyPolicyLink\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/privacyPolicyLink\u003e, and confirm that if you do not cancel at least 24 hours before the end of the \u003ctrialBillingPeriod\u003e\u003c/trialBillingPeriod\u003e for \u003ctrialPrice\u003e\u003c/trialPrice\u003e, you will be charged \u003cregularPrice\u003e\u003c/regularPrice\u003e per \u003cbillingPeriod\u003e\u003c/billingPeriod\u003e until you cancel your subscription by contacting our customer support team via email at \u003ccustomerSupportEmailLink\u003e\u003c/customerSupportEmailLink\u003e or in your account settings. Payments will be charged from the card you s