incorrect username/password combination.\",\"invalidArgument\":\"Invalid argument. Please try again\",\"unknownError\":\"Unknown error. Please try again\",\"emptyEmail\":\"Email must be specified\",\"invalidEmail\":\"Please enter a valid email address\",\"invalidPassword\":\"Password is too short (minimum is {amount} characters)\",\"emptyPassword\":\"Password must be specified\"}}},\"pdfToExtractLandingPage\":{\"metaData\":{\"title\":\"Extract Pages from PDF Online - {brandName}\",\"description\":\"Easily extract specific pages from your PDF: simply click 'Upload PDF' or drop your file in 'Drop PDF File Here' to start extracting the pages you need.\"},\"content\":{\"heroSection\":{\"title\":\"Online PDF Page Extractor\",\"caption\":\"Select and extract specific pages from PDFs — right in your browser.\",\"uploadField\":{\"caption\":\"or drop your file here\",\"buttonText\":\"Upload your file\",\"hint\":\"Size up to {size} MB.\"}},\"howItWorksSection\":{\"title\":\"Extract pages from a PDF in 3 steps\",\"stepList\":{\"first\":\"Upload your PDF file.\",\"second\":\"Choose the pages you want to extract and save changes.\",\"third\":\"Download the new PDF file.\"}},\"getStartedSection\":{\"title\":\"Extract pages from any PDF online\",\"caption\":\"Remove, add, or extract pages in the best PDF editor — upload now.\",\"action\":\"Upload your file\"}}},\"forgotPasswordPage\":{\"metaData\":{\"title\":\"Forgot Password\",\"description\":\"Reset your password easily.\"},\"resetPasswordForm\":{\"pageTitle\":\"Forgot your password?\",\"description\":\"Enter the email address associated with your account and we’ll send you a link to reset your password.\",\"emailLabel\":\"Email\",\"submitBtn\":\"Send Reset Link\",\"resetSuccessTitle\":\"Check your email\",\"resetSuccessText\":\"We sent an email to \u003cbold\u003e{email}\u003c/bold\u003e. Please be sure to check your spam folder too.\"}},\"resetPasswordPage\":{\"metaData\":{\"title\":\"Reset Password\",\"description\":\"Reset your password easily.\"},\"resetPasswordForm\":{\"pageTitle\":\"Create new password\",\"newPasswordLabel\":\"New password\",\"newPasswordPlaceholder\":\"At least {amount} characters\",\"confirmPasswordLabel\":\"Confirm new password \",\"submitBtn\":\"Set New Password\",\"resetSuccessText\":\"Your password has been successfully changed. You can now try logging in with your new password.\",\"errorMessages\":{\"emptyNewPassword\":\"New password must be specified\",\"emptyConfirmationPassword\":\"Password confirmation is required\",\"invalidPassword\":\"Password is too short (minimum is {amount} characters)\",\"invalidPasswordConfirmation\":\"Password confirmation does not match. Re-enter your password.\",\"failedValidation\":\"Password validation error\",\"outdatedToken\":\"Reset token is outdated\",\"unknownError\":\"Unknown error. Please try again\"}}},\"formPage\":{\"metaData\":{\"title\":\"{formName} Template\",\"description\":\"Fill {formName} Template, online.\"},\"formPage\":{\"pageTitle\":\"Get the most current {formName} {type} now\",\"getBtn\":\"Get form\",\"howItWorksSection\":{\"title\":\"Here’s how it works\",\"editForm\":{\"title\":\"01. Edit your {formName} online\",\"description\":\"Type text, add images, blackout confidential details, add comments, highlights and more.\"},\"signForm\":{\"title\":\"02. Sign it in a few clicks\",\"description\":\"Draw your signature, type it, upload its image, or use your mobile device as a signature pad.\"},\"shareForm\":{\"title\":\"03. Share your form with others\",\"description\":\"Send {formName} via email, link, or fax. You can also download it, export it or print it out.\"}},\"howToFillOutSection\":{\"title\":\"How to fill out a {formName} form?\",\"stepList\":{\"clickForm\":\"Click the \\\"Get my form\\\" button at the top of the page.\",\"editForm\":\"Edit your {formName} form. Rearrange and rotate pages, add or modify text, etc. \",\"clickDone\":\"When you’re ready, click \\\"Done\\\" to save your file. Choose the needed format and rename it if desired.\"}},\"getFormSection\":{\"title\":\"Complete this form in 5 minutes or less\",\"action\":\"Get form\",\"beReady\":\"be ready to get more\"},\"faqSection\":{\"title\":\"Got questions?\",\"caption\":\"We have answers to the most popular questions from our customers.\",\"questionList\":{\"howToFill\":{\"title\":\"How to fill out W-9 form\",\"text\":\"1. Enter your name or business name in the first line.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003e2. If applicable, check the appropriate box for your federal tax classification.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003e3. Provide your address in the next section.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003e4. Enter your taxpayer identification number (SSN or EIN) in the designated space.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003e5. Sign and date the form to certify that the information provided is accurate.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\"},\"whoNeeds\":{\"title\":\"Who needs W-9 form?\",\"text\":\"1. Individuals or businesses that are paid income subject to backup withholding are typically required to fill out a W-9 form.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003e2. Freelancers, independent contractors, and vendors who receive payments over $600 from a single payer in a tax year may also need to submit a W-9 form.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/br\u003e\"},\"whenNotRequired\":{\"title\":\"When is a W-9 form not required?\",\"text\":\"Certain individuals may not need to complete a W-9 form. For example, those not engaged in employment or independent contractor work within the United States may not need this form. Additionally, non-residents performing work outside the U.S. typically do not need to submit a W-9. It is primarily designed for U.S. persons, including citizens and residents, to provide their Taxpayer Identification Numbers to entities that pay them.\"},\"getBlank\":{\"title\":\"How to get a blank W-9 form?\",\"text\":\"For those needing to complete a W-9 form, our platform offers a blank template already loaded in our editor, allowing you to start filling it out immediately without needing to download it elsewhere. Remember, while PDF House assists in filling out and downloading the form, it does not support submitting it to relevant state structures.\"}}},\"additionalQuestionsSection\":{\"questionList\":{\"usage\":{\"title\":\"What is the W-9 form used for?\",\"description\":\"The W-9 form is crucial for accurate tax documentation, as it serves these key purposes:\",\"steps\":{\"provide\":\"Providing your Taxpayer Identification Number (TIN) to entities that pay you.\",\"certify\":\"Certifying your tax status as a U.S. person.\",\"declare\":\"Declaring any exemption from backup withholding, if applicable.\"}},\"whenNecessary\":{\"title\":\"When might filling out a W-9 not be necessary?\",\"description\":\"In certain cases, completing a W-9 may not be advisable. For example, if an unexpected party requests a W-9, make sure the reason for the request is valid. Financial institutions, such as banks, may use the W-9 form to report dividends at year-end; however, if they already have your TIN, submitting a new W-9 form might be redundant.\"},\"whenSubmit\":{\"title\":\"When should you submit an updated W-9?\",\"description\":\"It’s important to provide a new W-9 form to your employer or client whenever there’s a change in your personal or business information, such as a new address, new Social Security Number, or name change due to marriage or other reasons. Updating this information ensures that all tax documentation remains accurate.\"}}},\"instructionsSection\":{\"title\":\"Instructions for filling out the {formName} form:\",\"fieldLabel\":\"Line {number}\",\"fieldList\":{\"name\":\"\u003cbold\u003eName\u003c/bold\u003e – Enter your full name, ensuring it is spelled correctly and matches the spelling on other tax forms you’ve completed.\",\"businessName\":\"\u003cbold\u003eBusiness Name\u003c/bold\u003e – Complete this field only if you own a business and use a name (trade name, DBA, or entity name) different from the one in Line 1.\",\"taxClassification\":\"\u003cbold\u003eTax Classification\u003c/bold\u003e – Indicate your tax status according to IRS classification. Depending on whether you’re completing the form as an individual, corporation, LLC, partnership, or trust/estate, check the respective box. Only one box should be selected.\",\"exemptions\":\"\u003cbold\u003eExemptions\u003c/bold\u003e – If your entity is exempt from backup withholding, provide the appropriate code in the first line. If exempt from reporting under the Foreign Account Tax Compliance Act (FATCA), enter the relevant code in the second line. Note: Individuals typically do not complete this section.\",\"address\":\"\u003cbold\u003eAddress\u003c/bold\u003e – Enter your street address (including apartment number) so your employer can mail you information returns and notifications.\",\"cityInfo\":\"\u003cbold\u003eState, City, and ZIP Code\u003c/bold\u003e – Provide your city, state, and ZIP code.\",\"accountNumbers\":\"\u003cbold\u003eAccount Numbers\u003c/bold\u003e – You may list any account numbers your employer might need here. If none, leave this section blank.\"}},\"personalDetailsSection\":{\"title\":\"Personal Details Section\",\"description\":\"The second part of the form requires your personal details for your employer’s tax reporting. Fill out this section as follows:\",\"partLabel\":\"Part {number}\",\"partList\":{\"tin\":{\"title\":\"Taxpayer Identification Number (TIN)\",\"description\":\"Provide your Social Security Number (SSN) if you’re completing the form as an individual or single-member LLC, or your Employer Identification Number (EIN) if completing it as a corporation or partnership. Sole proprietors may use either number. Resident aliens without an SSN can use their TIN.\"},\"certification\":{\"title\":\"Certification\",\"description\":\"This final section certifies the accuracy of your information. Carefully review the form, ensure all entries are correct, then sign and date it in the designated fields.\"}}},\"reviewsSection\":{\"title\":\"What our users are saying\",\"reviewList\":{\"alexander\":{\"initials\":\"AC\",\"review\":\"With PdfHouse I merged two reports into one file. This helped me submit my work in a clean format. The merge pdf feature was easy to use. I just uploaded the files arranged the order and clicked one button. The file came out perfect. I liked how easy it is for office work.\",\"name\":\"Alexander C.\"},\"laurent\":{\"initials\":\"LD\",\"review\":\"Outstanding online pdf conversion experience with PDF House. Converted images to PDF format in seconds. The quality remained crystal clear. This online pdf service exceeds all my expectations completely.\",\"name\":\"Laurent D.\"},\"emma\":{\"initials\":\"EC\",\"review\":\"I needed to convert PDF to Word for a report. PDF House made it super easy. Now I use it all the time.\",\"name\":\"Emma C.\"},\"steve\":{\"initials\":\"ST\",\"review\":\"Quick, knowledgeable and helpful - easy to deal with.\",\"name\":\"Steve T.\"},\"oscar\":{\"initials\":\"OF\",\"review\":\"I tried pdf conversion without using any software. The online tool was very easy and fast. It helped me edit pdfs and merge pdf with no issues.\",\"name\":\"Oscar F.\"},\"nina\":{\"initials\":\"NS\",\"review\":\"Editing PDFs is super easy here. I use PDF House to crop pdf files when I want only a part of the page. It is simple and works very quickly.\",\"name\":\"Nina S.\"},\"amanda\":{\"initials\":\"AB\",\"review\":\"Very responsive agent and very helpful and concise.\",\"name\":\"Amanda B.\"},\"louise\":{\"initials\":\"LH\",\"review\":\"I needed to edit pdfs for my project and PdfHouse helped a lot. The merge pdf feature was easy to use. I also signed documents online and filled pdf forms fast. Online pdf conversion worked without problems. I will continue using this online pdf service for my assignments.\",\"name\":\"Louise H.\"}}},\"relatedFormsSection\":{\"title\":\"Related Forms\",\"form\":\"Form\",\"statement\":\"Statement\",\"viewButton\":\"View form\"},\"reviewScoreBase\":\"based on {count, plural, =1 {review} other {# reviews}}\"}},\"formsPage\":{\"metaData\":{\"title\":\"All forms\",\"description\":\"Search and fill form Template, online.\"},\"content\":{\"title\":\"All forms\",\"searchFormPlaceholder\":\"Form search\",\"form\":\"Form\",\"statement\":\"Statement\",\"application\":\"application\",\"template\":\"template\",\"viewButton\":\"View form\",\"noResultsFoundTitle\":\"No results found\",\"noResultsFoundDescription\":\"We couldn’t find what you’re looking for\"}},\"unsubscribeConfirmationPage\":{\"metaData\":{\"title\":\"Unsubscribe | confirmation\",\"description\":\"You always can switch or cancel plans.\"},\"confirmationPlate\":{\"title\":\"You always can switch or cancel plans\",\"subtitle\":\"After canceling your subscription, you will have access to premium features until your subscription expires.\",\"question\":\"Are you sure you want to cancel your subscription?\",\"cancelBtn\":\"Cancel subscription\",\"keepBtn\":\"Keep subscription\"},\"loosenBenefits\":{\"title\":\"Subscription includes all these tools and more:\",\"benefitList\":{\"conversation\":\"PDF Conversion\",\"documentsEditing\":\"Editing Documents\",\"signature\":\"Digital Signatures\",\"legalTemplate\":\"100+ Legal Templates\",\"accessLock\":\"Access From Anywhere\",\"virtualStorage\":\"Unlimited Storage\"}}},\"unsubscribeDiscountPage\":{\"metaData\":{\"title\":\"Unsubscribe | discount\",\"description\":\"Special offer just for you!\"},\"discount\":{\"title\":\"Wait, there's a special offer just for you!\",\"subtitle\":\"Stay with us and enjoy your special subscription price!\",\"exclusiveDeal\":{\"title\":\"Exclusive Deal\",\"subtitle\":\"Unlock your discounted monthly rate!\",\"benefitList\":{\"download\":\"Enjoy endless downloads and editing\",\"signature\":\"Sign and secure your documents\",\"forms\":\"Create and share your own forms\"}},\"discountFailed\":\"Oops! Something went wrong