l PDF Forms\",\"caption\":\"Easily complete and sign PDF forms online.\",\"uploadField\":{\"caption\":\"or drop your file here\",\"buttonText\":\"Upload your file\",\"hint\":\"Size up to {size} MB\"}},\"howItWorksSection\":{\"title\":\"Fill out your PDF in 3 simple steps\",\"stepList\":{\"first\":\"Upload the PDF file you want to modify.\",\"second\":\"Use the Text and Sign tools to fill in the required fields.\",\"third\":\"Review your changes and download the updated document.\"}},\"getStartedSection\":{\"title\":\"Fill Out PDFs with Ease\",\"caption\":\"Upload your PDF and complete forms effortlessly — fast and simple.\",\"action\":\"Upload your file\"}}},\"pdfToTemplateLandingPage\":{\"metaData\":{\"title\":\"Create PDF templates and forms online\",\"description\":\"Free online tool to quickly and securely add Create PDF templates. Fast, easy, and safe to use.\"},\"content\":{\"heroSection\":{\"title\":\"Create PDF templates and forms online\",\"caption\":\"Design reusable PDF templates or fillable form—right in your browser.\",\"uploadField\":{\"caption\":\"or drop your file here\",\"buttonText\":\"Upload your file\",\"hint\":\"Size up to {size} MB\"}},\"howItWorksSection\":{\"title\":\"Create a PDF form in 3 steps\",\"stepList\":{\"first\":\"Upload your PDF or create a blank document.\",\"second\":\"Add text fields, checkboxes, and signature blocks.\",\"third\":\"Download and use your new template or form.\"}},\"getStartedSection\":{\"title\":\"Try fillable forms and templates\",\"caption\":\"Start building interactive PDF forms—upload now.\",\"action\":\"Upload your file\"}}},\"pdfToTranslateLandingPage\":{\"metaData\":{\"title\":\"Translate PDF Online - Translate PDF Documents - {brandName}\",\"description\":\"Translate your PDF files online with {brandName}. Easily translate text in your PDF documents to any language quickly and securely right in your browser.\"},\"content\":{\"heroSection\":{\"title\":\"Translate PDF\",\"caption\":\"Easily translate text in your PDF—right in your browser.\",\"uploadField\":{\"caption\":\"or drop your file here\",\"buttonText\":\"Upload your file\",\"hint\":\"Size up to {size} MB\"}},\"howItWorksSection\":{\"title\":\"Translate your PDF in 3 Easy Steps\",\"stepList\":{\"first\":\"Upload your PDF file.\",\"second\":\"Choose your target language.\",\"third\":\"Preview and download your translated PDF.\"}},\"getStartedSection\":{\"title\":\"One click to translate your PDF\",\"caption\":\"Break language barriers—upload and translate now.\",\"action\":\"Upload your file\"}}},\"pdfToDrawLandingPage\":{\"metaData\":{\"title\":\"PDF Editor Online - Easily Edit, Convert, Compress PDFs - {brandName}\",\"description\":\"{brandName} is a Simple To Use Online PDF Editor. Quickly Edit, Convert, Merge, Compress, Sign and Secure Documents Online!\"},\"content\":{\"heroSection\":{\"title\":\"Draw on PDF\",\"caption\":\"Freely add drawings, annotations, and sketches to your PDF.\",\"uploadField\":{\"caption\":\"or drop your file here\",\"buttonText\":\"Upload your file\",\"hint\":\"Size up to {size} MB\"}},\"howItWorksSection\":{\"title\":\"Draw on your PDF in 3 simple steps\",\"stepList\":{\"first\":\"Upload the PDF file you want to modify.\",\"second\":\"Select the Draw tool and use your mouse or stylus to sketch.\",\"third\":\"Review your changes and download the updated document.\"}},\"getStartedSection\":{\"title\":\"Enhance Your PDFs with Drawings\",\"caption\":\"Upload your PDF and start drawing instantly — simple and intuitive.\",\"action\":\"Upload your file\"}}},\"pdfToViewLandingPage\":{\"metaData\":{\"title\":\"PDF Editor Online - Easily Edit, Convert, Compress PDFs - {brandName}\",\"description\":\"{brandName} is a Simple To Use Online PDF Editor. Quickly Edit, Convert, Merge, Compress, Sign and Secure Documents Online!\"},\"content\":{\"heroSection\":{\"title\":\"View PDF Online\",\"caption\":\"Open and read PDFs instantly from any device.\",\"uploadField\":{\"caption\":\"or drop your file here\",\"buttonText\":\"Upload your file\",\"hint\":\"Size up to {size} MB\"}},\"howItWorksSection\":{\"title\":\"View your PDF in 3 simple steps\",\"stepList\":{\"first\":\"Upload the PDF file you want to modify.\",\"second\":\"Instantly preview and navigate through the pages.\",\"third\":\"Review your changes and download the updated document.\"}},\"getStartedSection\":{\"title\":\"Open and Read PDFs with Ease\",\"caption\":\"Upload your PDF and view it online anytime — fast and convenient.\",\"action\":\"Upload your file\"}}},\"editTextOnImageLandingPage\":{\"metaData\":{\"title\":\"PDF Editor Online - Easily Edit, Convert, Compress PDFs - {brandName}\",\"description\":\"{brandName} is a Simple To Use Online PDF Editor. Quickly Edit, Convert, Merge, Compress, Sign and Secure Documents Online!\"},\"content\":{\"heroSection\":{\"title\":\"Edit Text on Image\",\"caption\":\"Modify or replace text in images with ease.\",\"uploadField\":{\"caption\":\"or drop your file here\",\"buttonText\":\"Upload your file\",\"hint\":\"Size up to {size} MB\"}},\"howItWorksSection\":{\"title\":\"Edit text on your image in 3 simple steps\",\"stepList\":{\"first\":\"Upload the PDF file you want to modify.\",\"second\":\"Use the Edit Text tool to modify or replace text.\",\"third\":\"Review your changes and download the updated document.\"}},\"getStartedSection\":{\"title\":\"Easily Edit Text in Images\",\"caption\":\"Upload your image and update the text in seconds.\",\"action\":\"Upload your file\"}}},\"editTextInImageLandingPage\":{\"metaData\":{\"title\":\"Edit Text in Images - {brandName}\",\"description\":\"Scan and extract text from PDFs—right in your browser. Edit text in images online with our free tool.\"},\"content\":{\"heroSection\":{\"title\":\"Edit text in images\",\"caption\":\"Modify or remove text from your photos with ease.\",\"uploadField\":{\"caption\":\"or drop your file here\",\"buttonText\":\"Upload your file\",\"hint\":\"Size up to {size} MB\"}},\"howItWorksSe