ext colors in your files—right in your browser.\",\"uploadField\":{\"caption\":\"or drop your file here\",\"buttonText\":\"Upload your file\",\"hint\":\"Size up to {size} MB\"}},\"howItWorksSection\":{\"title\":\"Change text color in a PDF in 3 steps\",\"stepList\":{\"first\":\"Upload your PDF file.\",\"second\":\"Select the text and choose a new color.\",\"third\":\"Download the edited PDF file.\"}},\"getStartedSection\":{\"title\":\"Change text color in PDFs\",\"caption\":\"Customize text colors quickly—upload now.\",\"action\":\"Upload your file\"}}},\"compressImageLandingPage\":{\"metaData\":{\"title\":\"Compress Image - {brandName}\",\"description\":\"Instantly compress your images without sacrificing quality or detail.\"},\"content\":{\"heroSection\":{\"title\":\"Compress Image\",\"caption\":\"Instantly compress your images without sacrificing quality or detail.\",\"uploadField\":{\"caption\":\"or drop your file here\",\"buttonText\":\"Upload your file\",\"hint\":\"Size up to {size} MB\"}},\"howItWorksSection\":{\"title\":\"Compress your Images in 3 easy steps\",\"stepList\":{\"first\":\"Upload your image file.\",\"second\":\"Click \\\"Compress\\\" button.\",\"third\":\"Download the optimized image.\"}},\"getStartedSection\":{\"title\":\"Instantly reduce Image file size\",\"caption\":\"Make your images easier to share and lighter to store — all with one click.\",\"action\":\"Upload your file\"}}},\"deleteImagePdfLandingPage\":{\"metaData\":{\"title\":\"Remove images from PDFs Online - {brandName}\",\"description\":\"Delete unwanted images or logos from your documents—right in your browser.\"},\"content\":{\"heroSection\":{\"title\":\"Remove images from PDFs Online\",\"caption\":\"Delete unwanted images or logos from your documents—right in your browser.\",\"uploadField\":{\"caption\":\"or drop your file here\",\"buttonText\":\"Upload your file\",\"hint\":\"Size up to {size} MB\"}},\"howItWorksSection\":{\"title\":\"Delete an image from a PDF in 3 steps\",\"stepList\":{\"first\":\"Upload your PDF file.\",\"second\":\"Wait until your file is processed and images are removed.\",\"third\":\"Download your edited PDF.\"}},\"getStartedSection\":{\"title\":\"Remove images from any PDF\",\"caption\":\"Clean up your PDF in seconds—upload now.\",\"action\":\"Upload your file\"}}},\"flattenPdfLandingPage\":{\"metaData\":{\"title\":\"Flatten PDF - Made Simple With {brandName}\",\"description\":\"Flatten PDF: Simply click on \\\"Upload to edit\\\" or drop your file in \\\"Drop PDF Files Here\\\". Make any edits your document may need.\"},\"content\":{\"heroSection\":{\"title\":\"Flatten PDF\",\"caption\":\"Convert interactive PDF forms and annotations into static content.\",\"uploadField\":{\"caption\":\"or drop your file here\",\"buttonText\":\"Upload your file\",\"hint\":\"Size up to {size} MB\"}},\"howItWorksSection\":{\"title\":\"Flatten your PDF file in 3 simple steps\",\"stepList\":{\"first\":\"Upload the PDF file you want to flatten.\",\"second\":\"The tool will automatically flatten all form fields and annotations.\",\"third\":\"Download your flattened PDF that cannot be edited.\"}},\"getStartedSection\":{\"title\":\"Turn PDFs into Read-Only Files\",\"caption\":\"Prevent edits by flattening form fields or the entire file.\",\"action\":\"Upload your file\"}}},\"subscriptionSuccessfullyUpdate\":{\"metaData\":{\"title\":\"Thank you | Your subscription has been successfully updated\",\"description\":\"Your subscription has been successfully updated\"},\"content\":{\"title\":\"Your subscription has been successfully updated!\",\"subtitle\":\"Your new plan is now active. You can now continue working with your documents, {email}.\",\"user\":\"Take care, {email}!\",\"backBtn\":\"Back to My docs\"}},\"questionnairePage\":{\"title\":\"What files do you edit most often?\",\"subtitle\":\"Choose the file types you work with most. Your input helps us improve our tools for you.\",\"submitButton\":\"SUBMIT\",\"otherPlaceholder\":\"Please specify other file types you work with...\",\"otherQuestionText\":\"What type of document is it?\",\"selectedCountText\":\"({selectedCount} of {totalCount} selected)\",\"countText\":\"({selectedCount} of {totalCount})\",\"success\":{\"title\":\"Thank you!\",\"subtitle\":\"Your response was submitted successfully.\"},\"categories\":{\"contracts_agreements\":{\"label\":\"Contracts and Agreements\",\"items\":{\"employment_contracts\":\"Employment contracts\",\"service_agreements\":\"Service agreements\",\"vendor_contracts\":\"Vendor contracts\",\"lease_agreements\":\"Lease agreements\",\"partnership_agreements\":\"Partnership agreements\",\"non_disclosure_agreements\":\"Non-disclosure agreements\"}},\"certificates_legal\":{\"label\":\"Certificates and Legal documents\",\"items\":{\"certificates\":\"Certificates\",\"lawsuits_legal_claims\":\"Lawsuits and legal claims\",\"powers_of_attorney\":\"Powers of attorney\",\"license_agreements\":\"License agreements\",\"regulatory_acts\":\"Regulatory acts in editable format\"}},\"accounting_financial\":{\"label\":\"Accounting and Financial documents\",\"items\":{\"invoices\":\"Invoices\",\"financial_reports\":\"Financial reports\",\"tax_documents\":\"Tax documents\",\"receipts\":\"Receipts\",\"bank_statements\":\"Bank statements\",\"budget_plans\":\"Budget plans\"}},\"educational_scientific\":{\"label\":\"Educational and Scientific materials\",\"items\":{\"research_papers\":\"Research papers\",\"academic_reports\":\"Academic reports\",\"course_materials\":\"Course materials\",\"thesis_dissertations\":\"Thesis and dissertations\"}},\"presentations_marketing\":{\"label\":\"Presentations and Marketing materials\",\"items\":{\"business_presentations\":\"Business presentations\",\"marketing_brochures\":\"Marketing brochures\",\"product_catalogs\":\"Product catalogs\",\"sales_materials\":\"Sales materials\",\"company_profiles\":\"Company profiles\",\"event_materials\":\"Event materials\"}},\"hr_recruiting\":{\"label\":\"HR and Recruiting\",\"items\":{\"job_descriptions\":\"Job descriptions\",\"resumes_cvs\":\"Resumes and CVs\",\"employee_handbooks\":\"Employee handbooks\",\"performance_reviews\":\"Performance reviews\"}},\"technical_documentation\":{\"label\":\"Technical documentation\",\"items\":{\"user_manuals\":\"User manuals\",\"api_documentation\":\"API documentation\",\"system_specifications\":\"System specifications\",\"installation_guides\":\"Installation guides\"}},\"other\":{\"label\":\"Other\",\"items\":{}}}},\"gdprConsent\":{\"overviewSection\":{\"title\":\"We Respect Your Privacy\",\"topDescription\":\"We and our technology partners request your consent to use cookies for storing/accessing and processing personal data on your device. This may include the use of unique identifiers and information regarding your browsing activity to optimize the user experience on our website. Below is an explanation of how your data may be utilized by us or our \u003cpartnersButton\u003epartners\u003c/partnersButton\u003e, as well as the types of cookies we employ.\",\"bottomDescription\":\"\u003cp\u003eYou don't have to consent in order to view the information on this site. However, if you do not consent, some personalization of content and advertising may not be available. Your preferences on this site will apply only to this site. You can withdraw your consent at any time by using the \\\"Manage Options\\\" link at the bottom of the page.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eSome of our partners process personal data based on legitimate interest. You have the right to object to this processing at any time. Please click \\\"Options\\\" below to view our list of partners and the purposes for which consent is required.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"accordionSection\":{\"essentialCookies\":{\"title\":\"Essential Cookies\",\"content\":\"These cookies are crucial for the operation of our service. They ensure security, detect abuse, and maintain your session while using the service. They assist in preventing fraud, spam, and phishing by identifying devices that create fraudulent accounts. Without these cookies, we cannot provide the services you have requested. You can block these cookies by adjusting your browser settings, but doing so may affect the functionality of essential features of our service.\"},\"functionalCookies\":{\"title\":\"Functional Cookies\",\"content\":\"These functional cookies enable us to operate specific features of the service based on your preferences. For instance, when you continue using or return to the service, we will recognize your username and retain your settings and content preferences. If you delete these cookies, it may limit the functionality of the service and reduce the level of personalization.\"},\"performanceCookies\":{\"title\":\"Performance Cookies\",\"content\":\"We use performance cookies and similar technologies to assess the performance of our service and identify areas for improvement. For example, they allow us to test different versions of the service to better understand user preferences and analyze how users interact with it. Certain third-party providers may also use cookies to analyze performance and track online activities across websites, apps, and devices, in accordance with their own cookie and privacy policies. These cookies are subject to the cookie and/or privacy policies of those third parties.\"},\"targetingCookies\":{\"title\":\"Advertising and Targeting Cookies\",\"content\":\"\u003cp\u003eWe use third-party targeting and advertising cookies to deliver ads tailored to your interests. These cookies also track the number of times an ad is shown to you, prevent excessive repetition, and help us evaluate the effectiveness of our advertisements.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eThese technologies also enable us to collaborate with publishers, developers, and ad networks to promote our Services across websites and apps, tailoring ads to your preferences and assessing their performance.\u003c/p\u003e\"},\"personalizedAndAdvertisingCookies\":{\"title\":\"Personalised advertising and content, advertising and content measurement, audience research and services development\",\"content\":\"Advertising and content may be personalized based on your profile. Your activity on this service can be used to build or enhance a profile for personalized advertising and content. The performance of advertising and content can be measured, and reports may be generated based on your activity as well as that of others. Your interactions with this service help develop and improve our products and services.\"}},\"buttons\":{\"reject\":\"Reject\",\"accept\":\"Accept\",\"options\":\"Options\"}},\"detailsSection\":{\"title\":\"Manage Your Privacy Preferences\",\"description\":\"We use this information to provide you with the best possible experience, including enhanced search results, more relevant content and promotions, better communication, and improved site performance. Below, you can adjust your cookie preferences by choosing whether to consent to certain cookies. You can also view the list of cookies that are strictly necessary for the operation of the site, as well as the list of vendors placing cookies on our behalf. For more information, please refer to our \u003cprivacyPolicyLink\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/privacyPolicyLink\u003e and \u003ccookiePolicyLink\u003eCookie Policy\u003c/cookiePolicyLink\u003e.\",\"consentDataId\":\"ID to request consent data -\",\"alwaysActiveLabel\":\"Always active\",\"tabs\":{\"categories\":\"Categories\",\"services\":\"Services\"},\"categories\":{\"targetingCookies\":\"Advertising and Targeting Cookies\",\"performanceCookies\":\"Performance Cookies\",\"specialPurposes\":\"Special Purposes\"},\"services\":{\"googleSyndication\":{\"title\":\"Google Syndication\",\"description\":\"$38\"},\"conversionLinker\":{\"title\":\"Conversion Linker\",\"description\":\"$39\"},\"doubleClickAd\":{\"title\":\"DoubleClick Ad\",\"description\":\"$3a\"},\"googleAds\":{\"title\":\"Google Ads\",\"description\":\"$3b\"},\"microsoftAdvertisingRemarketing\":{\"title\":\"Microsoft Advertising Remarketing\",\"description\":\"$3c\"},\"amplitude\":{\"title\":\"Amplitude\",\"description\":\"$3d\"},\"googleTagManager\":{\"title\":\"Google Tag Manager\",\"description\":\"$3e\"},\"hotjar\":{\"title\":\"Hotjar\",\"description\":\"$3f\"},\"microsoftClarity\":{\"title\":\"Microsoft Clarity\",\"description\":\"$40\"},\"trustpilot\":{\"title\":\"Trustpilot\",\"description\":\"$41\"},\"zendesk\":{\"title\":\"Zendesk\",\"description\":\"$42\"},\"cloudflare\":{\"title\":\"Cloudflare\",\"description\":\"$43\"},\"sentry\":{\"title\":\"Sentry\",\"description\":\"$44\"}},\"buttons\":{\"saveAndExit\":\"Save \u0026 Exit\",\"reject\":\"Reject All\",\"accept\":\"Accept All\"}}},\"extendedPricingPage\":{\"header\":{\"title\":\"Start using your document\",\"subtitle\":\"Your document is ready.\",\"subtitleSecondLine\":\"Choose a plan to download it now.\",\"buttonText\":\"Continue\",\"doneTag\":\"Done!\",\"readyText\":\"Ready for download!\"},\"plans\":{\"limited\":{\"title\":\"Limited access\",\"period\":\"/7-day trial\",\"description\":\"Essential PDF tools for quick fixes.\"},\"full\":{\"title\":\"Full access\",\"period\":\"/7-day trial\",\"description\":\"The complete PDF toolkit for every task.\",\"badge\":\"Most popular\"},\"annual\":{\"title\":\"Annual plan\",\"period\":\"/month\",\"description\":\"Maximum savings with VIP benefits.\",\"badge\":\"Save 36%\"}},\"features\":{\"edit\":\"Edit \u0026 save PDFs\",\"fill\":\"Fill in simple forms\",\"comments\":\"Add comments and highlights\",\"devices\":\"Access files on any device\",\"sign\":\"Sign documents online\",\"customize\":\"Create and customize forms\",\"fillable\":\"Add fillable fields\",\"templates\":\"Use ready-made templates\",\"convert\":\"Convert files to 300+ formats\",\"support\":\"Priority support 24/7\",\"early\":\"Early access to new features\",\"save\":\"Save more with annual billing\"},\"badges\":{\"new\":\"NEW\"},\"stickyBar\":{\"title\":\"Your document is ready to download!\",\"buttonText\":\"Continue\"},\"mobileBottomBar\":{\"buttonText\":\"Continue\"},\"featureSection\":{\"title\":\"All the tools to manage your PDFs\",\"editFiles\":{\"title\":\"Edit files\",\"description\":\"Change text, images, and layouts easily\"},\"convertFiles\":{\"title\":\"Convert files\",\"description\":\"Switch between formats like Word, Excel, JPG, and more\"},\"mergeFiles\":{\"title\":\"Merge files\",\"description\":\"Combine multiple files into a single document\"},\"compressFiles\":{\"title\":\"Compress files\",\"description\":\"Reduce file size without losing quality\"},\"ocr\":{\"title\":\"Text recognition (OCR)\",\"description\":\"Turn scanned files into editable text\"},\"signFiles\":{\"title\":\"Sign files\",\"description\":\"Add signatures and sign files online\"},\"splitFiles\":{\"title\":\"Split files\",\"description\":\"Separate pages or extract specific documents\"},\"addWatermark\":{\"title\":\"Add watermark\",\"description\":\"Protect your files with custom watermarks\"}},\"documentPreview\":{\"done\":\"Done!\",\"readyForDownload\":\"Ready for download!\",\"files\":\"files\"},\"faqSection\":{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"questionList\":{\"trial\":{\"title\":\"Do I get full access during the trial?\",\"text\":\"Yes, the trial gives you complete access to all tools and features according to the plan you choose.\"},\"whatHappens\":{\"title\":\"What happens after the 7-day trial ends?\",\"text\":\"The trial allows you to test the service for 7 days for $0.95. After that, your account automatically renews to the monthly plan for $49. You can cancel anytime before the trial ends to avoid this charge.\"},\"amI\":{\"title\":\"Am I tied to a long-term contract with the monthly plan?\",\"text\":\"Not at all. The monthly subscription is flexible. You can cancel at any time, and you will not be charged again once your current billing cycle ends.\"},\"cancel\":{\"title\":\"Can I cancel my subscription at any time?\",\"text\":\"Yes, you can cancel anytime directly from your account settings. You will keep access to your plan until the end of your current paid period, so you won't lose access abruptly.\"},\"refundRequest\":{\"title\":\"Can I request a refund for an unused subscription?\",\"text\":\"Yes. While we recommend canceling before your renewal date to avoid charges, we do offer a 7-day money-back guarantee. If you were charged for a plan you didn't use, just reach out to support within 7 days.\"}}},\"reviewsSection\":{\"title\":\"Trusted by people worldwide\",\"reviewList\":{\"alexander\":{\"initials\":\"AC\",\"review\":\"With PdfHouse I merged two reports into one file. This helped me submit my work in a clean format. The merge pdf feature was easy to use. I just uploaded the files arranged the order and clicked one button. The file came out perfect. I liked how easy it is for office work.\",\"name\":\"Alexander C.\"},\"laurent\":{\"initials\":\"LD\",\"review\":\"Outstanding online pdf conversion experience with PDF House. Converted images to PDF format in seconds. The quality remained crystal clear. This online pdf service exceeds all my expectations completely.\",\"name\":\"Laurent D.\"},\"emma\":{\"initials\":\"EC\",\"review\":\"I needed to convert PDF to Word for a report. PDF House made it super easy. Now I use it all the time.\",\"name\":\"Emma C.\"},\"steve\":{\"initials\":\"ST\",\"review\":\"Quick, knowledgeable and helpful - easy to deal with.\",\"name\":\"Steve T.\"},\"oscar\":{\"initials\":\"OF\",\"review\":\"I tried pdf conversion without using any software. The online tool was very easy and fast. It helped me edit pdfs and merge pdf with no issues.\",\"name\":\"Oscar F.\"},\"nina\":{\"initials\":\"NS\",\"review\":\"Editing PDFs is super easy here. I use PDF House to crop pdf files when I want only a part of the page. It is simple and works very quickly.\",\"name\":\"Nina S.\"},\"amanda\":{\"initials\":\"AB\",\"review\":\"Very responsive agent and very helpful and concise.\",\"name\":\"Amanda B.\"},\"louise\":{\"initials\":\"LH\",\"review\":\"I needed to edit pdfs for my project and PdfHouse helped a lot. The merge pdf feature was easy to use. I also signed documents online and filled pdf forms fast. Online pdf conversion worked without problems. I will continue using this online pdf service for my assignments.\",\"name\":\"Louise H.\"}}}}},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L45\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L46\",null,{\"direction\":\"ltr\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L47\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L48\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L49\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4a\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4b\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4d\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4e\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4f\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L50\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L51\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L52\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L53\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L54\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L55\",null,{\"theme\":\"pdf-house\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"error\":\"$undefined\",\"errorStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"errorScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":[[\"$\",\"$L56\",null,{}],[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/59d230522a59b69c.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]]],\"forbidden\":\"$undefined\",\"unauthorized\":\"$undefined\"}]}]}]}]}]}]]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"d:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"b:{\"metadata\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"PDF Editor Online - Easily Edit, Convert, Compress PDFs - PD